// Senognatos, captain of the levy camp in the lower town.
=== start
"You! You've got two arms and a spear. That's more than half of them." Senognatos waves at the camp: men in their own clothes, sharpening, sleeping, drilling badly. "The king wants every free man who can stand. Are you free? Can you stand?"
[quest vettius none] ~ quest vettius rumor
